        "zh-Hant" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "暫時無法切換電視，請先中斷連接再試。"}}
      }
    },
    "无法开始连接。请确认电视和手机在同一 Wi-Fi。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cannot start the connection. Check that your TV and phone share the same Wi-Fi."}},
        "zh-Hant" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "無法開始連接。請確認電視與手機連接同一個 Wi-Fi。"}}
      }
    },
    "暂时无法断开，请重试。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Cannot disconnect right now. Please try again."}},
        "zh-Hant" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "暫時無法中斷連接，請重試。"}}
      }
    },
    "请先连接 Chromecast。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "Connect to a Chromecast first."}},
        "zh-Hant" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "請先連接 Chromecast。"}}
      }
    },
    "这个视频需要 DRM 授权，暂时无法投屏。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "This video requires DRM authorization and cannot be cast."}},
        "zh-Hant" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "這部影片需要 DRM 授權，暫時無法投放。"}}
      }
    },
    "电视无法播放这个视频。请回到网页重新播放，再试一次。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The TV cannot play this video. Play it again on the webpage, then retry."}},
        "zh-Hant" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "電視無法播放這部影片。請回到網頁重新播放，再試一次。"}}
      }
    },
    "电视加载超时。手机仍可继续播放，请检查连接或重新检测视频。" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "The TV took too long to load. Playback can continue on your phone. Check the connection or detect the video again."}},
        "zh-Hant" : {"stringUnit": {"state": "translated", "value": "電視載入逾時。手機仍可繼續播放，請檢查連接或重新偵測影片。"}}
      }
    },
    "网页视频" : {
